1
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:46,000
Lin Xia: This is the Lightcup Mini product weekly at Nanzhi Household, about thirty minutes. We will look at the trial, decide what this batch will not change, then lock the launch.

2
00:00:48,000 --> 00:01:05,000
Lin Xia: Here today: Lin Xia, Zhou Heng, and Shen Yu. Numbers in this meeting come only from the trial and the facts we already have.

3
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:32,000
Zhou Heng: We sent 20 trial units last week and got 14 replies.

4
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:28,000
Shen Yu: Support logged 6 questions about weight and 3 about crushing ice.

5
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:48,000
Lin Xia: The facts say about 420 grams. Trial users who commute said it is heavy in a bag.

6
00:04:40,000 --> 00:05:20,000
Zhou Heng: The blade base and the battery are most of the weight. This batch's mold cannot change. The next mold can aim for 380 grams. The battery stays 2000 mAh.

7
00:06:15,000 --> 00:06:48,000
Shen Yu: It cannot crush ice or nuts. Frozen fruit needs 5 minutes to thaw. That is already in the manual, so the answers should repeat it.

8
00:07:30,000 --> 00:08:10,000
Lin Xia: We are not changing the material this week. It stays Tritan, and it is BPA free. This batch is sold as about 420 grams. The page must not say it is already lighter.

9
00:08:50,000 --> 00:09:30,000
Zhou Heng: Agreed. I will deliver a 380 gram structure sketch for the next version by March 11. It does not change this batch. If I cannot hit 380 grams, I will write the real estimate on the sketch.

10
00:10:20,000 --> 00:10:48,000
Lin Xia: Colors. Cream and mist blue are both tooled. Mist blue led the trial by 4 votes.

11
00:11:40,000 --> 00:12:05,000
Zhou Heng: Both colors are tooled, so this batch ships both. Do not drop cream.

12
00:12:30,000 --> 00:13:05,000
Lin Xia: Agreed. This batch keeps cream and mist blue, side by side on the page. We will not say most popular.

13
00:14:05,000 --> 00:14:32,000
Shen Yu: Someone asked if we are the lowest price online. We have no basis for that, so we cannot write it.

14
00:15:20,000 --> 00:15:58,000
Lin Xia: Launch stays 18 March 2026. The price is 99 yuan, and the first 100 orders get a sleeve. No previous price and no units-sold number.

15
00:16:05,000 --> 00:16:28,000
Shen Yu: Understood. I will not invent units sold, stock, or review counts.

16
00:16:40,000 --> 00:17:15,000
Lin Xia: I will lock the launch list: title, detail page, 7-day returns, and a 1-year motor warranty. I will send it to the group by March 11.

17
00:18:10,000 --> 00:18:36,000
Zhou Heng: If the cup is not seated it will not start. Keep that on the detail page.

18
00:19:30,000 --> 00:20:05,000
Shen Yu: A full charge is about 3 hours, and a full charge is about 15 cups. I will not write a number we have not measured.

19
00:21:00,000 --> 00:21:36,000
Lin Xia: Support answers only what the facts already say. If it is not there, say you will check and reply. Do not invent an answer.

20
00:22:15,000 --> 00:22:55,000
Shen Yu: By March 9 I will write 5 answers: weight, ice, charging, returns, and warranty. Each one follows a line we already have. No new promises.

21
00:23:20,000 --> 00:23:50,000
Zhou Heng: If the sketch is far from 380 grams, I will put the real estimate on the drawing and not round it to a neat number.

22
00:24:10,000 --> 00:24:55,000
Lin Xia: That is the decision. The answers add no new promise. If the estimate is more than 20 grams off 380, we talk again next week. This week we still want the sketch.

23
00:26:40,000 --> 00:27:05,000
Zhou Heng: If the gap is over 20 grams I will mark it in the sketch title.

24
00:27:40,000 --> 00:28:10,000
Lin Xia: Good. Next week, same time, we review the sketch and the 5 answers.

25
00:28:50,000 --> 00:29:08,000
Shen Yu: I will send the draft answers to Lin Xia first, for a quick look.

26
00:29:20,000 --> 00:29:40,000
Lin Xia: Thanks. That is all for today.
